                "enum": [
                  "model_provider_unconfigured",
                  "sandbox_unconfigured",
                  "drive9_unconfigured",
                  "drive9_disabled_for_organization"
                ]
              },
              "provider": {
                "description": "Present only with code model_provider_failed. The failure category, the HTTP status the supplier returned and the supplier's own error type and code, each null when unknown. A supplier redirect is never followed and reads as supplier_error with the 3xx status and errorType redirect. Never supplier message text, request paths or credentials.",
